{
  "question": "Can I use my impact driver to assemble the BikerBed?"
}

{
  "answerable": true,
  "answer": "No, please don't use an impact driver. The installation instructions specifically say not to. Use an electric screwdriver with Allen (hex) bits or a standard bike multitool instead. When you fit the brackets, the six screws only need to be finger tight with a 4 mm Allen key, so you won't need much force anyway.",
